"""LLVM as a single shared library -- an experiment, not yet wired up.

This builds, and it is NOT usable as-is. Two things stand between it and a
compiler that links LLVM dynamically, both recorded in RELEASE.md:

1. Symbol visibility. bazel/internal/cc-toolchain/args/BUILD.bazel:124-125
   applies -fvisibility=hidden to the whole toolchain, LLVM included, so this
   dylib comes out with ~13,000 defined text symbols and 192 exported. Nothing
   outside it can call in. The fix is a per-file copt in the same style as the
   nixl_upstream line in bazel/internal/common.bazelrc:175, scoped to the
   llvm-project external path -- and it rebuilds LLVM.

2. Making the mojo binary consume it. The deps flow transitively through many
   KGEN cc_library targets, and _shared_library does not produce
   CcSharedLibraryInfo, so bazel's dynamic_deps will not accept it. Linking
   LLVM both statically and dynamically into one process duplicates its
   ManagedStatic and cl::opt registries, which is its own class of crash.

Before spending time on it, note what it does and does not buy. This release
ships one tool. A dylib plus a thinner mojo weighs about what today's mojo
weighs, so there is no size win. The win is incremental relink time while
working on the compiler, and sharing one LLVM across kgen, kgen-opt,
compilation-server and mojo if they are all built.
"""

load("//bazel:api.bzl", "modular_shared_library")

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

modular_shared_library(
    name = "LLVMShared",
    srcs = [],
    # With no srcs there are no undefined symbols, so the linker pulls nothing
    # out of the deps' archives and the dylib comes out empty. -all_load takes
    # every object rather than only those that resolve something.
    linkopts = ["-Wl,-all_load"],
    output_name = "LLVM",
    tags = ["manual"],  # not part of //... -- see the note above
    deps = [
        "@llvm-project//llvm:AArch64CodeGen",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:BitReader",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:BitWriter",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:CodeGen",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:Core",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:ExecutionEngine",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:IRReader",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:JITLink",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:MC",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:OrcJIT",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:Passes",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:Support",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:Target",
        "@llvm-project//llvm:TransformUtils",
    ],
)
